==== SCRIPT ====
printf '%s' '{"a":[1,2,3],"b":{"c":4}}' | jq -c '[paths], [paths(type == "number")], [path(..)], [path(.a[])], [path(.a[1:])], path(.b.c), (path(.a | first)), [paths(..)]'
